ering about his\u00a0standing\n\nOne of the Philadelphia 76ers' most surprising players so far this season has been Jabari Walker. Back in the offseason, many expected Walker to get the boot when the Sixers were adding Kentavious Caldwell-Pope to the roster. For\u2026"}, "embed": {"external": {"uri": "https://freeaitoolsayoob.com/nick-nurse-doesnt-leave-jabari-walker-wondering-about-his-standing/?utm_source=bluesky&utm_medium=jetpack_social", "title": "Nick Nurse doesn\u2019t leave Jabari Walker wondering about his\u00a0standing", "description": "One of the Philadelphia 76ers' most surprising players so far this season has been Jabari Walker. Back in the offseason, many expected Walker to get the boot when the Sixers were adding Kentavious Caldwell-Pope to the roster. For financial reasons, the Sixers had to cut ties with somebody on a standard deal. Walker seemed like the obvious candidate, seeing as though he's on a deal that won't be fully guaranteed until early 2027."}, "$type": "app.bsky.embed.external#view"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-11-08T22:35:05.573Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:4h2onudgo236aisjiaii5jik/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzthsg4dgk2f", "cid": "bafyreicreb2uf5ebu722ssdtm7tzcfnw4eq2r6vxcfc43r2kqorrcxdyem", "author": {"did": "did:plc:4h2onudgo236aisjiaii5jik", "handle": "bearc.bsky.social", "displayName": "Brendan", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:4h2onudgo236aisjiaii5jik/bafkreif45lya5knii5djopkspd6igfkfntgxd3qv5pqgazydyx6b6gbrbi", "associated": {"activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-10-20T19:01:12.542Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-11-08T22:33:54.970Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.record", "record": {"cid": "bafyreid2uehpwkldo3uffxgrwpys45c7vwikl267cyccnyvalrsdxvjwn4", "uri": "at://did:plc:6zpqfxuncvcqqxxuqas3ucff/app.bsky.feed.post/3mztguxfpfk2